<title>AUSTRALIA: MOTOR RACING-GRID POSITIONS FOR THE AUSTRALIAN GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-GRID POSITIONS FOR THE AUSTRALIAN GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
